{"id":"wb-7-176","name":"大溪东瓯古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大溪东瓯古城遗址","text":"大溪东瓯古城遗址位于浙江省台州市温岭市里宅、大岙等村，为战国晚期西汉早期城址。浙江省文物考古研究所于2002年、2006年、2008年先后三次对遗址进行地面调查、钻探和考古试掘。城址范围东西长约390米，南北宽约260米，面积约10万平方米。2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%BA%AA%E4%B8%9C%E7%93%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86856324,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856324","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c87bc89dde408bc41c718afb.jpg","title":"大溪东瓯古城遗址,_2022-02-14_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E6%BA%AA%E4%B8%9C%E7%93%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80,_2022-02-14_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/%E5%A4%A7%E6%BA%AA%E4%B8%9C%E7%93%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%2C_2022-02-14_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​大溪东瓯古城遗址","width":320,"height":214}}